OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum thought she had foot issues`
OL,4,Abut it was MND'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Lynne Gittins decided to get a
OL,7,Fproblem with her foot checked out, she
OL,8,Fhad no idea that it would lead to a
OL,9,Fdiagnosis of Motor Neurone Disease
OL,10,F(MND).
OL,12,FThe 70-year-old from Norfolk is now
OL,13,Fliving with the worsening effects of
OL,14,Fthe degenerative disease, and, like
OL,15,Fmany, she did not recognise the earlier
OL,16,Fsymptoms.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
