OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum thought she had foot issues`
OL,4,Abut it was MND'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow her son Tom Waterhouse, has walked
OL,7,F100 miles in a 33-hour non-stop walk
OL,8,Facross Norfolk, raising more than
OL,9,F#5,000 to help boost awareness of the
OL,10,Fdisease and find better ways to
OL,11,Fdiagnose it.
OL,13,FMr Waterhouse, 40, said his mother may
OL,14,Fhave had the condition for some time
OL,15,Fbefore she was diagnosed, adding: "She
OL,16,Fhad a dodgy foot which wasn't too much
OL,17,Fof an issue, she walked with a stick
OL,18,Ffor a while, we put it down to bad
OL,19,Fcirculation or nerve issue."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
